<section class="panel"><h2>Agent status</h2><div id="agents"><div class="agent"><span>Business Owner</span><span class="agent-state active">Active orchestrator</span></div><div class="agent"><span>Product Manager</span><span class="agent-state planned">Ready specialist</span></div></div></section>
